Package: pulzr-edge
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Description: Pulzar edge runtime: the pulzr-edge binary Modbus, Zigbee and Z-Wave run on.
 Provides no capability of its own: pulzr-modbus, pulzr-zigbee and pulzr-zwave
 each bring one and depend on this, so a gateway locked off one capability can
 still have the others. Runs a radio's module (pulzr-edge-radios) only when its
 protocol's add-on is installed. Built from github.com/pulzar-net/pulzr-edge
 with the OpenWrt SDK; see sdk/packages/pulzr-edge.
